      "text": "all things are ready: come unto the marriage, Matt. 22:4. be ye also ready: for … the Son of man cometh, Matt. 24:44 (Luke 12:40; JS—M 1:48). ready went in with him to the marriage, Matt. 25:10. disciples … made ready the passover, Matt. 26:19 (Mark 14:16; Luke 22:13). spirit truly is ready, but the flesh is weak, Mark 14:38. make ready a people prepared for the Lord, Luke 1:17. Lord, I am ready to go with thee, Luke 22:33. your time is alway ready, John 7:6. I am ready not to be bound only, Acts 21:13. I am ready to preach the gospel to you, Rom. 1:15. declaration of your ready mind, 2 Cor. 8:19. be rich in good works, ready to distribute, 1 Tim. 6:18. be ready to every good work, Titus 3:1. faith unto salvation ready to be revealed, 1 Pet. 1:5. be ready always to give an answer, 1 Pet. 3:15. ready to judge the quick and the dead, 1 Pet. 4:5. his wife hath made herself ready, Rev. 19:7.",
